"{\n \"lang\": \"en-US\",\n \"languageTitle\": \"Language\",\n \"fields\": [\n  {\n   \"key\": \"ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN\",\n   \"label\": \"Access token · RequiredSecret\",\n   \"help\": \"ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN · File\",\n   \"options\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"key\": \"ANS_PI_BASE_URL\",\n   \"label\": \"API base URL · Required\",\n   \"help\": \"ANS_PI_BASE_URL · File\",\n   \"options\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"key\": \"ANS_PI_MODEL\",\n   \"label\": \"Model · Required\",\n   \"help\": \"ANS_PI_MODEL · File\",\n   \"options\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"key\": \"ANS_PI_REASONING_EFFORT\",\n   \"label\": \"Reasoning effort · Optional\",\n   \"help\": \"ANS_PI_REASONING_EFFORT · File. Leave empty to keep the platform default (no change). Levels are off / low / medium / high / xhigh (see the platform for the default level's meaning). Thinking counts toward output tokens.\",\n   \"options\": [\n    \"Empty (platform default)\",\n    \"Off\",\n    \"Low\",\n    \"Medium\",\n    \"High\",\n    \"XHigh\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"key\": \"ANS_PI_CONTEXT_WINDOW\",\n   \"label\": \"Context window · Optional\",\n   \"help\": \"ANS_PI_CONTEXT_WINDOW · Default. Drag to pick a preset; maximum 1M tokens. Leave empty for the system default (500k). Applied when the next session opens.\",\n   \"options\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"key\": \"ANS_PI_PROMPT_TIMEOUT_MS\",\n   \"label\": \"Watchdog check limit · Optional\",\n   \"help\": \"ANS_PI_PROMPT_TIMEOUT_MS · Default. At the limit, the governance role is only asked to check whether the turn is stuck; the turn is not aborted. If it is still progressing, no action is taken; one hour is the last-resort limit. Leave empty for the system default (5 minutes). Unit: ms. Applied when the next session opens.\",\n   \"options\": []\n  }\n ]\n}"
